title: "AI Study Workbench (socratic-workbench): No-Spoiler Active-Recall & Pseudocode-Compiler Methodology for Learning Anything with AI"
message: "If you use this skill, methodology, or workbench template in your study workflow, courses, or research, please cite it as below."
