abstract: >-
  An open-source cross-agent Skill and multi-domain study workbench methodology that turns AI assistants from answer-spoilers into strict Socratic study coaches using separated answer keys, scenario-based gap probing, and deterministic 4-slot native-language pseudocode compilation.
